## Code Conventions
- All rasters in `EPSG:4326` (WGS84) for consistency; reproject to `EPSG:32750` (UTM Zone 50S) for distance-based operations
- Raw data in `data/raw/` (gitignored); processed features in `data/processed/`
- Notebooks numbered `01_`, `02_` etc. — one per pipeline stage
- Core logic in `geo_ml/` package; notebooks import from package, never duplicate logic
- Always save prospectivity output as GeoTIFF for GIS compatibility
- SHAP importance plot required before any result is considered final
- Report both AUC-ROC and spatial selectivity (concentration-area) for every model
